hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2151","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Unkey liye unkey paimaanay aur unkey saa aur unkey mudd mein barkat farma! (Bukhari: 6714). Faraez ki kitaab."
"2152","[AI-translation] Yazeed key betey Saaeb (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Saa Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein tumhaarey aaj key mudd se mudd aur tihaai tha. (Bukhari: 6712)"
